## monero-project

The images contain binaries built from [woodser/monero](https://github.com/woodser/monero), a fork of [monero-project/monero](https://github.com/monero-project/monero), which is released under the BSD 3-Clause license, Copyright (c) 2014-2022, The Monero Project. Its license is in `/usr/share/licenses/monero-project/LICENSE` in the images. The files in [patches](patches) are changes to its sources and are under the same license. The `private-testnet` patch is by woodser, from [haveno-dex/monero](https://github.com/haveno-dex/monero).

The `monero-wallet-light` image also contains [monero-lws](https://github.com/vtnerd/monero-lws), released under the BSD 3-Clause license, Copyright (c) 2018-2020, The Monero Project. Its license is in `/usr/share/licenses/monero-lws/LICENSE` in the image.

The sources of monero-project include components with their own licenses, among them RandomX (BSD 3-Clause), easylogging++ (MIT) and rapidjson (MIT).

## Libraries in the binaries

`monerod` and `monero-wallet-rpc` are linked statically with these libraries, installed by [bin/install_dependencies.sh](bin/install_dependencies.sh):

| Library | License |
|---------|---------|
| [musl libc](https://musl.libc.org) | MIT |
| libstdc++ and libgcc | GPL-3.0-or-later with the GCC Runtime Library Exception |
| [Boost](https://www.boost.org) | BSL-1.0 |
| [OpenSSL](https://www.openssl.org) | Apache-2.0 |
| [libsodium](https://libsodium.org) | ISC |
| [Unbound](https://nlnetlabs.nl/projects/unbound/) | BSD-3-Clause |
| [ZeroMQ](https://zeromq.org) | LGPL-3.0-or-later with a static linking exception |

Boost, OpenSSL and libsodium come from the packages of Alpine Linux, Unbound and ZeroMQ are built from the source archives listed in `bin/install_dependencies.sh`. This repository has the scripts to build the binaries again from source, so the libraries can be replaced.

## Images

The images are based on [Alpine Linux](https://alpinelinux.org), whose packages carry their own licenses.
